  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to &#xc9;cole de Maintien de la Paix - capacity building and training</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to improve the economic, social, and political positioning of women and strengthen their leadership skills and opportunities within their communities, through:

(1) Training and capacity building (project management, gender-sensitive planning and budgeting, prevention of GBV and assistance to victims, WPS, etc.) of central actors in the peace process, including security forces, 
(2) Financial and technical support for community-based projects initiated by women to strengthen female financial independence and contribute to social cohesion and security.</narrative>
  </description>
